OL,3,A'One in, one out' scheme costs #56,000
OL,4,Aper person returned to France, home
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government's "one in, one out"
OL,8,Fscheme to send migrants who cross the
OL,9,FChannel back to France costs on average
OL,10,F#56,000 per person, Home Secretary
OL,11,FShabana Mahmood has said.
OL,13,FThat is higher than the Home Office's
OL,14,Festimated average cost for enforced
OL,15,Fmigrant returns of #48,800.
OL,17,FThe deal allows the UK to return some
OL,18,Fsmall boat arrivals while agreeing to
OL,19,Ftake in the same number of people from
OL,20,FFrance who are believed to have a
OL,21,Flegitimate claim to come to Britain.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
