OL,3,A'One in, one out' scheme costs #56,000
OL,4,Aper person returned to France, home
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FMahmood told MPs the policy had been
OL,8,F"difficult" to scale up and the numbers
OL,9,Finvolved were still "relatively small".
